## Brute Force

```python
class Solution:
    def transform(self, s1, s2):
        if len(s1) != len(s2):
            return -1

        n = len(s1)

        if sorted(s1) != sorted(s2):
            return -1

        for k in range(n + 1):
            # Keep suffix of s1 and move remaining chars to front
            if s1[k:] == s2[:n-k]:
                return k

        return -1
```

**TC:** O(n² log n)
**SC:** O(n)

